用餐皆宜",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi22NWPxNKWAxWRf_UHHU1lM70Q3YcHCMoBKAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwi22NWPxNKWAxWRf_UHHU1lM70Q3IcHCMkBKBY",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi22NWPxNKWAxWRf_UHHU1lM70Q3YcHCMwBKAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwi22NWPxNKWAxWRf_UHHU1lM70Q3IcHCMsBKBc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這家日式洋食真的讓人驚艷。每一道菜都非常入味，而且都有不同的驚喜，吃完整套會覺得層次豐富、用心十足。\n\n鴨肉料理特別出色，肉質鮮嫩多汁，熟度掌握得剛剛好。炊飯一開始看起來有點平淡，甚至有些 anti-climactic，但越吃越能嚐到淡淡的燒烤香氣，後勁十足，反而成為讓人回味的一道。\n\n主餐前還貼心地提供番茄汁解膩，清爽開胃。服務更是加分，有著高級餐廳般細緻的講解與介紹，完全不像一般連鎖店的制式服務。\n\n最驚喜的是，兩人七道式套餐只要1800台幣，真的超划算，CP值極高。下次一定會再訪。\n\nThis Japanized Western restaurant truly impressed me. Every dish was deeply flavorful, and each course brought a different surprise, making the entire meal feel thoughtfully curated and well-balanced.\n\nThe duck was exceptionally tender and cooked to perfection. The rice pot initially felt a little anti-climactic, but as I continued eating, a subtle smoky, grilled aroma gradually emerged, leaving a lingering and satisfying finish.\n\nBefore the main course, we were served tomato juice to cleanse the palate — a thoughtful and refreshing touch. The service was equally impressive, with detailed explanations like those in a fine-dining restaurant. It certainly didn’t feel like a typical chain outlet.\n\nBest of all, the seven-course meal for two was only TWD 1,800 — incredibly worth it for the quality and experience. Definitely a place I would revisit.",null,[0,94]]]],[null,1772262377000000,1772262377000000,"6 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfOTdra2Qwc1oxYmljZDJPRE44M1JCQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfOTdra2Qwc1oxYmljZDJPRE44M1JCQRoSQ2dzSTZhZUt6UVlRcEtLTER3\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi22NWPxNKWAxWRf_UHHU1lM70Q_2MIzQEoGA"],"https://business.google.co